# Flake-window laps for 4/disk/caw/mpath on the 0.90.131 release candidate
# (main tree, mxfs.ko srcversion 92FBF2A83F12160EE95EA2E), on rig group g4
# (test3..test6), before the release chain's board.
#
# Why: tools/criteria_window.py 4/disk/caw/mpath owes laps_before_board=10 for
# dirent_type_integrity, path_failover, path_fabric, path_flap,
# path_mount_degraded, chk_clean, guard_census, dlm_lock_correctness (newest
# genuine FAIL at window index 0 or 1, on builds 8DAEC6B8/C047499E).  Each FAIL
# is attributed in an open record (type-flip/poison ESTALE, the two-dirents
# directory re-log, the census inventory); the laps are the rig half of those
# records' verification on the candidate, and they age the window.  A lap that
# fails is a measurement: it is attributed from its own lines before anything
# else, never re-run to get a pass.  alloc_witness runs with chk_clean (the
# release verdict needs the witness under the same run id).
#
# Bound per lap (tests/suite/manifest budgets, the board's own):
#   prep_cluster 300 + dirent_type_integrity 60 + path_failover 300 +
#   path_fabric 300 + path_flap 240 + path_mount_degraded 300 +
#   alloc_witness 120 + chk_clean 180 + guard_census 20 +
#   dlm_lock_correctness 60 + chain overhead outside the rows 160
#   (measured 130-160 s on tests/queues/fence_return_kept_logs_netmesh_mpath.queue)
#   = 2040 s, plus dirent_durability 240 + dirent_publish_integrity 60 = 2340 s.
#
# dirent_type_integrity grades the kernel-log window dirent_durability opens
# (MXFS_DIRENT_WINDOW, tests/suite/dirent_type_integrity.sh:56-99), so every
# lap runs dirent_durability and dirent_publish_integrity before it, as the
# board does (manifest rows 24, 28, 29).  The first launch of this queue
# (label qw_4-disk-caw-mpath, lap qw4m1_0.90.131) left dirent_durability out:
# its dirent_type_integrity FAIL 'no MXFS_DIRENT_WINDOW marker on this node'
# measured nothing; that queue was stopped after lap 1 and these laps follow it.
2340 tests/board_4node_chain.sh qw4m2_0.90.131 4/disk/caw/mpath:dirent_durability,dirent_publish_integrity,dirent_type_integrity,path_failover,path_fabric,path_flap,path_mount_degraded,alloc_witness,chk_clean,guard_census,dlm_lock_correctness@g4
2340 tests/board_4node_chain.sh qw4m3_0.90.131 4/disk/caw/mpath:dirent_durability,dirent_publish_integrity,dirent_type_integrity,path_failover,path_fabric,path_flap,path_mount_degraded,alloc_witness,chk_clean,guard_census,dlm_lock_correctness@g4
